{'symbol': 'ABT', 'date': '2019-11-04 16:30:00', 'title': 'FDA SAYS ABBOTT RECALLED CENTRIMAG CIRCULATORY SUPPORT SYSTEM MOTOR', 'text': "ABBOTT RECALLS CENTRIMAG CIRCULATORY SUPPORT SYSTEM MOTOR DUE TO PUMP AND MOTOR ISSUES.FDA SAYS HAS IDENTIFIED ABBOTT'S RECALL OF CENTRIMAG CIRCULATORY SUPPORT SYSTEM MOTOR AS A CLASS I RECALL.FDA SAYS 44 INJURIES & 1 DEATH WERE REPORTED AT TIME WHEN ABBOTT INITIATED RECALL IN AUGUST 2019.FDA SAYS ABBOTT IS RECALLING THEIR CENTRIMAG SYSTEM DUE TO CALIBRATION SYSTEM ERROR RESULTING FROM ELECTROMAGNETIC INTERFERENCE.FDA SAYS CENTRIMAG CIRCULATORY SUPPORT SYSTEM MOTOR RECALLED BY ABBOTT WERE DISTRIBUTED BETWEEN NOV. 22, 2017 AND AUG. 6, 2019.FDA SAYS ABBOTT RECALLED 381 CENTRIMAG CIRCULATORY SUPPORT SYSTEM MOTORS IN THE U.S.."}